@startuml
' State diagram for user management
'left to right direction
'top to bottom direction
hide empty description
scale 1.25
'skinparam linetype ortho
'skinparam linetype polyline
title  User states and its transitions

' State transitions
[*] -> UNREGISTERED: on inviting

UNREGISTERED -> REGISTERED: on registration
UNREGISTERED --u--> UNREGISTERED_LOCKED: on N invalid secret key attempts
UNREGISTERED -d-> INVITE_EXPIRED: on expiration of invite
UNREGISTERED -d--> INVITE_CANCELLED: on cancelling of invite

INVITE_EXPIRED -> UNREGISTERED: on re-generating secret key / \n on resending invite
note left of INVITE_EXPIRED
  Backend service expires
  the invite after a
  stipulated time.
end note

INVITE_CANCELLED -> UNREGISTERED: on re-generating secret key

REGISTERED -u-> REGISTERED_LOCKED: on N invalid password attempts
REGISTERED -d-> PASSWORD_EXPIRED: on expiration of password
REGISTERED -d-> ACCOUNT_LOCKED: on N invalid attempts \n to recover password

PASSWORD_EXPIRED -> REGISTERED: on updating password
note right of PASSWORD_EXPIRED
  Backend service expires
  the password after a
  stipulated time.
end note

state LOCKED {
  state UNREGISTERED_LOCKED {
  }
  state REGISTERED_LOCKED {
  }
  state ACCOUNT_LOCKED {
  }
}
UNREGISTERED_LOCKED -> UNREGISTERED: on re-generating secret key
REGISTERED_LOCKED -> REGISTERED: on unlocking
REGISTERED_LOCKED -> REGISTERED: on auto-unlocking
ACCOUNT_LOCKED -> REGISTERED: on unlocking

state ARCHIVED {
  archived:true --> archived:false : on un-archiving
  archived:false --> archived:true : on archiving
}
note right of ARCHIVED
   archived flag is present with all the states.
   This boolean value determines whether the user
   has been archived or not
 end note

' State description
UNREGISTERED: User has been added in the backend \n but has not yet REGISTERED/registered.
REGISTERED: User has registered itself using secret key \n shared by administrator or received in the email.
INVITE_EXPIRED: The secret key has expired. \n User will have to contact Administrator \n for the re-generating secret key.
INVITE_CANCELLED: The invite has been cancelled. \n User will have to contact Administrator \n for the re-invitation.
PASSWORD_EXPIRED: The password has expired. \n User will have to update its password.
LOCKED: User has been locked and can no longer use the application.
ARCHIVED: User has been archived and can no longer use the application.
ARCHIVED: This is tracked via a boolean flag and NOT via state
@enduml